1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Eleventh Episode
The Spirit of Sleep

15
00:02:43,221 --> 00:02:45,291
Sapphire, are you coming to play?

16
00:02:46,821 --> 00:02:48,459
Hello, Choppy!

17
00:02:48,581 --> 00:02:50,572
- Let's go!
- Prince!

18
00:02:50,621 --> 00:02:52,737
Why that sneaky look?

19
00:02:52,781 --> 00:02:55,341
- Sneaky look?!
- He's not doing anything wrong.

20
00:02:55,381 --> 00:02:58,373
Don't you remember that you
are on vacation? You can play here!

21
00:02:58,421 --> 00:03:00,457
- What?!
- Great!

22
00:03:00,501 --> 00:03:03,174
I'm on vacation!
We can have fun!

23
00:03:03,221 --> 00:03:06,896
Now that you are far from the
palace, don't let yourself go too much!

24
00:03:06,941 --> 00:03:09,614
Remember the promises
that you made to your mother?

25
00:03:09,661 --> 00:03:12,698
The first is to continue
to be good!

26
00:03:13,221 --> 00:03:14,734
And what is the second?

27
00:03:14,781 --> 00:03:16,419
The second is...

28
00:03:16,461 --> 00:03:18,929
To be patient
during this week of vacation.

29
00:03:18,981 --> 00:03:20,812
...and curb my spirit
of adventure.

30
00:03:20,861 --> 00:03:24,934
- Don't forget it!
- Then, goodbye, Opal!

31
00:03:29,341 --> 00:03:33,016
That was a close call! And who is this running
into me?! Help!

32
00:03:34,381 --> 00:03:37,453
Esteemed Garigori, do you happen to know
where the Prince is?

33
00:03:37,501 --> 00:03:40,891
Doctor, does this seem like
the time to come disturbing?

34
00:03:40,941 --> 00:03:43,774
It doesn't matter. I have something
too important to report.

35
00:03:43,821 --> 00:03:46,289
You can find the Prince
on the hill,

36
00:03:46,341 --> 00:03:49,299
but mind, next time,
not to be so early!

37
00:04:03,181 --> 00:04:05,411
Sapphire, look at what a beautiful landscape!

38
00:04:06,541 --> 00:04:11,740
We are the squires of the King!
How heavy this pleasure weighs!

39
00:04:11,781 --> 00:04:14,853
- Isn't that the King's throne?
- Yes, it is my father's.

40
00:04:17,501 --> 00:04:19,298
I wonder what is happening...

41
00:04:19,341 --> 00:04:21,616
Your Highness! Prince Sapphire!

42
00:04:23,301 --> 00:04:25,895
Please, return immediately
to your residence.

43
00:04:25,941 --> 00:04:28,011
No, because right now I'm playing.

44
00:04:28,061 --> 00:04:30,052
You must obey me, Your Highness!

45
00:04:33,421 --> 00:04:36,618
- What a pity...!
- No! No! No!

46
00:04:36,661 --> 00:04:40,131
I don't want to wear it!
Why do I have to put on this dress?

47
00:04:40,181 --> 00:04:43,571
It's for the ceremony you will have to
go through because the King is sick.

48
00:04:43,621 --> 00:04:45,577
- Who will I receive?
- Messer Plastic.

49
00:04:45,621 --> 00:04:48,215
Messer Plastic?!
Do you mean Geralamon's son?

50
00:04:48,261 --> 00:04:50,331
Yes, that stupid son of his!

51
00:04:50,381 --> 00:04:53,896
Quiet! If the Grand Duke hears you
talking like that, he'll make you pay!

52
00:04:53,941 --> 00:04:55,738
His promotion is being celebrated:

53
00:04:55,781 --> 00:04:58,341
after eight years in first grade, he was
promoted to second grade...!

54
00:04:58,381 --> 00:05:00,941
Eight years for him to pass
first grade?!

55
00:05:02,181 --> 00:05:04,536
Please don't laugh!

56
00:05:08,421 --> 00:05:11,015
His Excellency
the Grand Duke Geralamon!

57
00:05:18,301 --> 00:05:20,417
He is proud of his son

58
00:05:28,621 --> 00:05:32,330
You didn't hurt yourself, Plastic?
Don't worry, everything is fine!

59
00:05:32,381 --> 00:05:36,215
Come on, now go up the grand staircase
and greet them as they taught you.

60
00:05:36,381 --> 00:05:39,373
Show everyone that you are
much better than Sapphire.

61
00:05:39,421 --> 00:05:41,616
Neelon, did you teach him
the protocol?

62
00:05:41,661 --> 00:05:43,538
- Yes, perfectly!
- Here he is.

63
00:05:44,021 --> 00:05:46,012
Hi, Plastic! How's it going?

64
00:05:48,101 --> 00:05:50,695
- Hi! - Prince, I ask you
to receive my son...

65
00:05:50,741 --> 00:05:55,019
...according to tradition.
- I wanted to congratulate him.

66
00:05:55,101 --> 00:05:57,695
Well, I thank you on his
behalf! Did you hear, Plastic?

67
00:05:57,741 --> 00:06:01,177
- Answer the Prince.
- I'm going to answer! I'm going!

68
00:06:03,101 --> 00:06:05,490
Stop! You are not
going the right way!

69
00:06:05,541 --> 00:06:08,009
To get to the Prince,
you must turn to the right!

70
00:06:08,061 --> 00:06:10,859
- Oh, no!
- To the right...

71
00:06:17,060 --> 00:06:19,017
What did you teach him?!

72
00:06:19,060 --> 00:06:20,813
I did my best!

73
00:06:21,420 --> 00:06:23,412
There is nothing to laugh about!

74
00:06:23,820 --> 00:06:26,415
Let's skip the
formalities and go play.

75
00:06:26,460 --> 00:06:28,452
Grand Duke, I'm
taking Plastic to play!

76
00:06:28,500 --> 00:06:31,334
He who laughs last laughs best,
Prince Sapphire!

77
00:06:35,100 --> 00:06:37,820
Remember that, during the meal,
you must behave properly at the table!

78
00:06:37,860 --> 00:06:39,658
You must use a fork and knife,
not your hands,

79
00:06:39,700 --> 00:06:41,737
you must remain seated
and not pick your nose!

80
00:06:43,700 --> 00:06:45,896
And don't throw breadcrumbs!
You must che...

81
00:06:47,100 --> 00:06:50,013
Chew with your mouth closed, don't make
rude noises and don't start crying!

82
00:06:50,100 --> 00:06:51,819
Damn, what a struggle!

83
00:06:52,820 --> 00:06:54,379
My nose!

84
00:06:56,020 --> 00:06:58,296
Damn, what a struggle
teaching this blockhead!

85
00:06:58,340 --> 00:07:00,332
Did you get all of that through your thick skull?

86
00:07:04,260 --> 00:07:07,810
- I am so sorry, Grand Duke!
- What are you doing, you complete idiot?

87
00:07:07,860 --> 00:07:11,615
I was just pleasantly surprised
by your son's intelligence!

88
00:07:11,660 --> 00:07:14,220
It's true! My son, after all,
is very intelligent!

89
00:07:30,420 --> 00:07:33,060
I propose a toast
to Plastic's promotion! Bravo!

90
00:07:33,180 --> 00:07:35,570
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

91
00:07:40,700 --> 00:07:43,010
I will not allow Sapphire
to sit on the throne.

92
00:07:43,060 --> 00:07:45,939
Even if he pretends to be
a boy, she is a girl!

93
00:07:45,980 --> 00:07:48,495
And since the law of this land
forbids a girl...

94
00:07:48,540 --> 00:07:51,578
...to ascend the throne,
if I manage to get rid of the Prince,

95
00:07:51,620 --> 00:07:53,691
then the throne will be Plastic's!

96
00:07:53,740 --> 00:07:56,778
In fact, since I
am the King's only brother,

97
00:07:56,820 --> 00:07:59,016
you have every right to it,
my son.

98
00:07:59,060 --> 00:08:01,211
Should people take him
for a blockhead? No!

99
00:08:01,260 --> 00:08:03,456
I will seat him on the throne
at all costs!

100
00:08:10,420 --> 00:08:12,491
Plastic, where are you going? I'm coming with you!

101
00:08:13,220 --> 00:08:15,212
Ehi, Plastic! Wait for me!

102
00:08:16,780 --> 00:08:18,772
Where are you going? Why don't we play?

103
00:08:18,820 --> 00:08:21,415
Since you're here,
let's play together, shall we?

104
00:08:22,900 --> 00:08:26,098
How beautiful! I like these
so much! They are so good!

105
00:08:26,140 --> 00:08:28,450
I want to take them!

106
00:08:30,220 --> 00:08:33,099
It's a painting! You
can't eat painted things!

107
00:08:33,140 --> 00:08:36,577
- I want to eat it!
- This strawberry looks real..

108
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:39,499
...because it is painted very well,
but you can't pull it off of there!

109
00:08:39,540 --> 00:08:41,816
- I want to eat it! I want it!
- Don't throw a tantrum!

110
00:08:41,860 --> 00:08:45,774
That is a painting! Oh, good
heavens, now he got angry!

111
00:08:45,861 --> 00:08:48,898
I apologize!
Plastic, come back!

112
00:08:48,941 --> 00:08:50,533
Sorry!

113
00:08:51,741 --> 00:08:54,892
I want to eat it!
I want the strawberries!

114
00:08:54,941 --> 00:08:57,250
It's impossible! It's
summer now, Plastic!

115
00:08:57,301 --> 00:08:59,531
Strawberries only
grow in spring!

116
00:08:59,581 --> 00:09:01,492
I want a strawberry!

117
00:09:01,901 --> 00:09:04,699
Grand Duke! Your son will be
able to eat strawberries, even if...

118
00:09:04,741 --> 00:09:07,016
Do you mean we can
get some strawberries?

119
00:09:07,061 --> 00:09:10,417
Absolutely! In the middle of the
woods, strawberries also grow in summer!

120
00:09:10,461 --> 00:09:12,258
Go pick them right now!

121
00:09:12,301 --> 00:09:14,019
You will have them sooner than you think.

122
00:09:14,061 --> 00:09:16,017
I sent some
soldiers to pick them.

123
00:09:16,061 --> 00:09:18,529
I told them that
this spoiled boy...

124
00:09:18,581 --> 00:09:21,812
...who is asking for strawberries
out of season is Prince Sapphire.

125
00:09:22,101 --> 00:09:24,012
You did well.

126
00:09:30,621 --> 00:09:33,010
What is this noise?

127
00:09:36,621 --> 00:09:40,739
They said that whoever returns with the
strawberries will get a handsome reward.

128
00:09:41,301 --> 00:09:44,099
- I will get that reward!
- No, I'll be the one to win it!

129
00:09:44,141 --> 00:09:46,894
- I will find them!
- That prize will be mine!

130
00:09:49,461 --> 00:09:52,737
- Who is pushing me?
- Let's go!

131
00:09:53,821 --> 00:09:56,813
- Help! Fire!
- Run away!

132
00:10:10,741 --> 00:10:12,459
Help!

133
00:10:16,021 --> 00:10:18,410
Watch where you're going?!

134
00:10:19,101 --> 00:10:21,137
Run! Run!

135
00:10:39,461 --> 00:10:43,659
- Help! A monster!
- Run away!

136
00:10:44,301 --> 00:10:46,178
Another monster!

137
00:11:02,901 --> 00:11:05,017
Attack it!

138
00:11:09,821 --> 00:11:12,893
Tell the truth: you didn't
expect these wonders, did you?

139
00:11:12,941 --> 00:11:15,501
- But that's the devil!
- Who could it be?

140
00:11:16,021 --> 00:11:19,411
Fools! Your weapons
are useless against me,

141
00:11:19,461 --> 00:11:23,010
spirit of sleep! I will punish you
for staying awake tonight!

142
00:11:23,061 --> 00:11:25,017
- Wake up, sprite!
- Here I am!

143
00:11:25,261 --> 00:11:28,173
- Give me the sleep powder!
- Right away!

144
00:11:30,381 --> 00:11:33,100
Powder of anger,
powder of tears,

145
00:11:33,141 --> 00:11:35,336
powder of laughter,
powder of sleep!

146
00:11:35,381 --> 00:11:37,576
Here it is! To you, little brother!

147
00:11:39,501 --> 00:11:42,493
Now I will punish you! Fall asleep!

148
00:11:44,021 --> 00:11:47,013
I can't keep
my eyes open...

149
00:11:48,581 --> 00:11:51,891
The powder has no effect on me,
because I am an angel.

150
00:11:54,541 --> 00:11:56,930
No one can resist sleep!

151
00:12:00,621 --> 00:12:03,818
Who sent you to disturb
the peace of the forest tonight?

152
00:12:03,861 --> 00:12:06,455
It was Prince Sapphire!
Suddenly he said...

153
00:12:06,501 --> 00:12:08,935
..that he wanted to eat
some strawberries.

154
00:12:08,981 --> 00:12:12,690
Prince Sapphire... I know him,
because he often comes to play.

155
00:12:12,741 --> 00:12:15,209
Hey, sprite, how can I punish him?

156
00:12:27,421 --> 00:12:30,174
Now, my dear Plastic.

157
00:12:31,261 --> 00:12:33,855
Have a little patience!
Let's do a test.

158
00:12:33,901 --> 00:12:36,131
Let me see
how you look on the throne.

159
00:12:44,621 --> 00:12:46,612
You are incompetent!

160
00:12:46,941 --> 00:12:49,614
I told you to sit on the throne!

161
00:12:49,661 --> 00:12:52,494
Oh, you look so good
on that throne!

162
00:12:52,541 --> 00:12:54,452
It seems made just for you!

163
00:12:54,501 --> 00:12:57,857
One of these days, you will be sitting
there with the crown on your head!

164
00:12:57,901 --> 00:13:00,017
And it will be all thanks to me!

165
00:13:01,621 --> 00:13:04,738
Yes, mother, I will try to
be diligent! Just as you want!

166
00:13:04,781 --> 00:13:07,011
Don't worry!
I will be good.

167
00:13:07,061 --> 00:13:09,131
I won't get angry! I won't fight!

168
00:13:25,181 --> 00:13:28,617
Spoiled prince! The spirit of
sleep has come to punish you...

169
00:13:28,661 --> 00:13:31,733
...for your tantrums, which have
disturbed the peace of the forest!

170
00:13:31,781 --> 00:13:34,454
Damn!
He is fast asleep.

171
00:13:34,501 --> 00:13:37,379
...and I certainly cannot punish someone
who is sleeping! I'll have to wake him up!

172
00:13:37,421 --> 00:13:40,015
And I will do just... that!

173
00:13:40,061 --> 00:13:43,656
- Hey! Who is it?!
- I am the spirit of sleep!

174
00:13:43,701 --> 00:13:46,261
I will make sure that you
can no longer sleep! There!

175
00:13:47,261 --> 00:13:49,616
Why do you want to give me this punishment?

176
00:13:50,101 --> 00:13:52,217
Don't pretend you don't know!

177
00:13:52,261 --> 00:13:54,411
You woke up
the entire forest!

178
00:13:54,461 --> 00:13:56,258
- Take this!
- No, it's not true!

179
00:13:56,301 --> 00:13:59,054
- Didn't you want the strawberries?
- I assure you, I didn't ask for them!

180
00:13:59,101 --> 00:14:01,137
May I know who wanted them,
then?

181
00:14:01,181 --> 00:14:04,412
Well, you see...
I can't tell you!

182
00:14:04,461 --> 00:14:07,134
- You're making fun of me, aren't you?
- What?!

183
00:14:08,541 --> 00:14:12,136
If he won't say it, I will! It was
Plastic who wanted the strawberries!

184
00:14:12,181 --> 00:14:14,137
Why did you tell him?

185
00:14:14,181 --> 00:14:16,820
Good! And so it was
Plastic! I must go punish him!

186
00:14:16,861 --> 00:14:19,739
Look, if you do anything to
Plastic, I won't forgive you!

187
00:14:20,021 --> 00:14:22,012
Get out of the way!

188
00:14:22,221 --> 00:14:24,098
Goodbye, little one!

189
00:14:24,541 --> 00:14:27,772
- No, wait!
- Then so much the worse for you!

190
00:14:28,101 --> 00:14:30,012
Spirit of the wind!

191
00:14:34,021 --> 00:14:36,899
See how it doesn't pay
to go against me?

192
00:14:36,941 --> 00:14:39,501
If you want war,
you'll have it! Take this!

193
00:14:39,541 --> 00:14:41,293
And this!

194
00:14:43,821 --> 00:14:45,493
Take that!

195
00:14:51,541 --> 00:14:55,136
I won't continue! I promised my
mother that I wouldn't get angry.

196
00:14:57,141 --> 00:15:00,531
- Help!
- If you hadn't wanted to hit me,

197
00:15:00,581 --> 00:15:03,254
- you wouldn't have fallen.
- Poor elf!

198
00:15:03,301 --> 00:15:06,293
Hey! Aren't you ashamed to mistreat
such a small child?

199
00:15:06,341 --> 00:15:09,890
I didn't want to mistreat him! He suddenly
tried to hit me,

200
00:15:09,941 --> 00:15:12,375
so I took a step to the side
and he fell!

201
00:15:12,701 --> 00:15:15,135
Well done, little elf!

202
00:15:15,301 --> 00:15:17,815
Anyway,
he deserves a punishment too!

203
00:15:17,861 --> 00:15:20,216
I will make sure
that he doesn't wake up again!

204
00:15:24,661 --> 00:15:27,095
I think he has lost consciousness.

205
00:15:28,661 --> 00:15:31,175
Alright, I will forgive him!
Come with me!

206
00:15:31,221 --> 00:15:32,700
Here I am!

207
00:15:34,701 --> 00:15:36,612
I want to eat strawberries!

208
00:15:38,461 --> 00:15:40,531
There he is! Did you see? It's that one over there!

209
00:15:41,301 --> 00:15:44,293
- Grand Duke! Little Grand Duke!
- Who wants me?

210
00:15:45,301 --> 00:15:48,896
Little Grand Duke! Tiny Grand Duke!

211
00:15:49,181 --> 00:15:51,012
But... But who is it?!

212
00:15:55,301 --> 00:15:58,816
Hey, spoiled brat! Do you know
that they ruined the sleep...

213
00:15:58,861 --> 00:16:02,297
...of all the forest inhabitants
because of your tantrums?

214
00:16:02,341 --> 00:16:04,332
What's there to laugh about?

215
00:16:05,581 --> 00:16:08,857
As a punishment
for your insolence,

216
00:16:08,901 --> 00:16:11,176
I will stop you from sleeping forever!

217
00:16:17,141 --> 00:16:20,292
Plastic! What happened to you,
my son?

218
00:16:21,421 --> 00:16:23,571
The soldiers didn't
find the strawberries.

219
00:16:23,621 --> 00:16:25,577
Forget about
this nonsense!

220
00:16:25,621 --> 00:16:27,612
There's something wrong with Plastic!

221
00:16:27,661 --> 00:16:29,617
Yes, I know. It's his
head that's the problem.

222
00:16:30,301 --> 00:16:32,019
Idiot!

223
00:16:39,501 --> 00:16:42,254
It is beyond my power
to cure an idiot!

224
00:16:44,581 --> 00:16:46,572
I'll take care of curing you!

225
00:16:46,621 --> 00:16:50,011
Now close your eyes gently! You are sleepy!
You are getting sleepier and sleepier!

226
00:16:50,061 --> 00:16:53,019
You are so sleepy! You
can't wait to go to bed!

227
00:17:01,101 --> 00:17:04,332
I command you to close
those goddamned eyes!

228
00:17:04,381 --> 00:17:06,212
Obey!

229
00:17:06,381 --> 00:17:08,690
Come on, my dear child! Close them!

230
00:17:08,941 --> 00:17:12,217
- Is Plastic here?
- What do you want, Prince?

231
00:17:12,261 --> 00:17:15,617
Geralamon, perhaps I can cure him.
Just a moment!

232
00:17:17,821 --> 00:17:20,813
- Opal!
- Your Highness, where do you want to go?

233
00:17:20,861 --> 00:17:23,739
I must go into the forest
to look for the spirit of sleep

234
00:17:24,581 --> 00:17:28,017
I won't let you go! It could
do to you what it did to Plastic!

235
00:17:28,141 --> 00:17:31,577
Everything will be fine.
Plastic cannot stay like this.

236
00:17:32,541 --> 00:17:35,055
Do you know that Plastic
is your enemy?

237
00:17:35,221 --> 00:17:37,894
It's true!
He is the son of Geralamon

238
00:17:37,941 --> 00:17:40,409
...and the Grand Duke wants him to
ascend the throne in your place!

239
00:17:40,501 --> 00:17:43,891
- You know it well! Don't help him!
- Enough!

240
00:17:48,581 --> 00:17:52,893
Spirit of sleep!
Spirit of sleep, where are you?

241
00:17:53,181 --> 00:17:56,298
Where are you, spirit? Little spirit!

242
00:17:58,261 --> 00:18:00,377
Spirit of sleep!

243
00:18:05,581 --> 00:18:08,015
- Spirit of sleep, please!
- What do you want?

244
00:18:08,061 --> 00:18:10,734
Have you come to get
revenge for the other night?

245
00:18:10,781 --> 00:18:14,569
Darkness, fall! - I didn't come
to get my revenge!

246
00:18:14,621 --> 00:18:16,816
I cannot fight
if it isn't dark.

247
00:18:16,861 --> 00:18:18,692
And now it's pitch black!

248
00:18:18,741 --> 00:18:21,938
More brushwood! Yes!
Make him dance some more!

249
00:18:21,981 --> 00:18:24,211
- A little more!
- Enough!

250
00:18:24,261 --> 00:18:26,411
Enough! Stop! Enough!

251
00:18:26,461 --> 00:18:29,373
Please, enough! Enough!

252
00:18:29,781 --> 00:18:32,215
Please, turn Plastic
back to how he was!

253
00:18:32,261 --> 00:18:35,094
- No way!
- I am so sorry...

254
00:18:35,141 --> 00:18:37,416
...about the soldiers.
You're right, I know.

255
00:18:37,461 --> 00:18:40,100
You're saying that to me
because you're so afraid of me!

256
00:18:40,141 --> 00:18:44,100
But you can't... Oh, no! I
promised not to get angry!

257
00:18:44,421 --> 00:18:47,299
- Pixie, teach him a little lesson.
- At your command!

258
00:19:04,341 --> 00:19:06,218
I slept...

259
00:19:06,261 --> 00:19:08,855
Right, now I remember! You
were the one who put me to sleep!

260
00:19:09,501 --> 00:19:12,459
- And who the hell are you?
- That's what I'm asking you.

261
00:19:12,541 --> 00:19:15,533
- You are very impertinent!
- No, you're the impertinent one!

262
00:19:15,581 --> 00:19:17,572
You are very impertinent!

263
00:19:22,901 --> 00:19:26,735
How is it that Sapphire takes all
of this and hasn't gotten angry yet?

264
00:19:26,781 --> 00:19:28,692
I get it!

265
00:19:28,741 --> 00:19:30,652
In those jars there
is magic powder!

266
00:19:30,701 --> 00:19:33,898
What a coward! It's
unbelievable that he's a Prince!

267
00:19:36,101 --> 00:19:39,855
I need the anger powder. Which
one is it? Ah, here, it's this one!

268
00:19:47,341 --> 00:19:49,901
Now I feel really angry!

269
00:19:50,741 --> 00:19:52,936
Do you think it's over? Look!

270
00:19:57,621 --> 00:19:59,418
Listen to me!

271
00:19:59,501 --> 00:20:02,140
You don't even have the
strength to stand on your feet!

272
00:20:02,461 --> 00:20:05,897
Are you still provoking me?
Too bad for you, spirit of sleep!

273
00:20:05,941 --> 00:20:08,011
I will challenge you to a duel!

274
00:20:08,821 --> 00:20:11,210
Well? Where did
you put all your fight?

275
00:20:11,261 --> 00:20:14,537
Take this! And this! And this!

276
00:20:15,221 --> 00:20:17,212
Sprite, help!

277
00:20:27,941 --> 00:20:30,899
Now let's settle the
score... Look up there!

278
00:20:31,901 --> 00:20:34,017
Now will you come and cure Plastic?

279
00:20:34,421 --> 00:20:36,651
No! It's useless to threaten me!

280
00:20:36,861 --> 00:20:39,659
Then tell me how
I can cure Plastic!

281
00:20:39,901 --> 00:20:42,290
If you ask me like
that, I will never tell you!

282
00:20:42,341 --> 00:20:44,377
Tell me, I beg you!

283
00:20:44,421 --> 00:20:47,219
If you do what I ask
of you, then I'll tell you!

284
00:20:48,101 --> 00:20:51,776
- I accept!
- Then kneel on the ground and beg me!

285
00:20:51,821 --> 00:20:54,381
Do you really want me
to get down on my knees?

286
00:20:54,421 --> 00:20:57,652
Just as I said:
kneel and beg me!

287
00:20:58,421 --> 00:21:00,696
What's the matter? You can't do it?

288
00:21:00,741 --> 00:21:04,051
A Prince never stoops
to such things!

289
00:21:04,861 --> 00:21:07,694
I beg you,
show me what I can do.

290
00:21:09,861 --> 00:21:12,739
How amusing! A Prince
kneeling before me!

291
00:21:12,781 --> 00:21:15,215
Tell me if he looks like a Prince to you!

292
00:21:16,301 --> 00:21:18,257
And he's begging me, too!

293
00:21:21,221 --> 00:21:24,133
- Now I...
- Isn't this enough for you?

294
00:21:29,901 --> 00:21:32,131
Well, now I'll tell you.

295
00:21:32,741 --> 00:21:36,495
But you must be crazy to do
such things for another person.

296
00:21:36,901 --> 00:21:38,732
He is a human being.

297
00:21:54,101 --> 00:21:56,376
My poor son!

298
00:21:57,221 --> 00:21:59,815
- I can cure him!
- What is that jar?

299
00:21:59,861 --> 00:22:01,817
If you hurt my baby...

300
00:22:01,861 --> 00:22:04,421
This is the powder that will make
him go back to how he was before.

301
00:22:12,821 --> 00:22:15,130
He has woken up!

302
00:22:17,661 --> 00:22:20,414
I am happy to see
that you are well again!

303
00:22:21,421 --> 00:22:24,140
Your Highness, I have
no words to thank you!

304
00:22:24,181 --> 00:22:27,412
Silence! What I did I
certainly didn't do for you.

305
00:22:32,701 --> 00:22:35,295
Grand Duke, here is the powder
that always keeps one awake.

306
00:22:35,341 --> 00:22:37,252
Do you want him to be sick again?

307
00:22:37,301 --> 00:22:40,338
But I got it to put it
on the Prince! What do you think?

308
00:22:40,581 --> 00:22:42,378
- On Sapphire?
- Yes! There is no need

309
00:22:42,421 --> 00:22:45,254
...to thank him too much just
because he saved your son.

310
00:22:45,301 --> 00:22:48,611
I was in the forest while he
was asking the spirit what to do...

311
00:22:48,661 --> 00:22:50,731
...and I saw
that he didn't try all that hard!

312
00:22:50,781 --> 00:22:52,897
Do not forget
that, as long as the Prince is alive,

313
00:22:52,941 --> 00:22:54,818
your son will not be able to
sit on the throne!

314
00:22:54,861 --> 00:22:57,011
Right, for a while
I had forgotten it.

315
00:22:57,621 --> 00:23:00,181
Leave it to me!
I know what to do!

316
00:23:20,621 --> 00:23:23,852
Hello, friend! I was just
dreaming that you were saving me!

317
00:23:23,901 --> 00:23:27,450
You shouldn't have such foolish dreams!
You must sleep soundly.

318
00:23:27,821 --> 00:23:30,130
I wonder if there is still
any child awake..!

319
00:23:30,181 --> 00:23:33,173
I'm going to do a patrol.
Goodnight!

320
00:23:33,221 --> 00:23:35,291
Sleep well, friends!

321
